desc: RCBitNova V0.3 - Bit-Accurate M/S Dynamic EQ (static + Mode A + Mode B Soft/Hard cascade + shelf dynamics A+B + proportional-Q bells)

// License: GPL - http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html
// Author: Dima Gorelik (design with Claude)
// Bit logic: 1 bit = 6.0206 dB; gain_lin = 2^((macro + micro/100) * bitratio).
// Filters: TPT state-variable (Andy Simper / Cytomic). All state instance-local
// (NOT gmem) - fixes the cross-instance bug of the gmem-based bit EQ.
// Phase 1: static engine, zero-latency, 4 slider bands, no dynamics/GUI.
// Shelf dynamics: Shelf ceiling = peak of the shelf-region detector
// (HP tap for High Shelf, LP tap for Low Shelf, fixed Q 0.7071);
// -3 dB at cutoff, passband -> unity. The Low Shelf detector is unity
// at DC by design (rumble/boom tamer) - it reacts to DC offset.
// Shelf Mode B (split limiter): extracts the shelf region (HP branch for High
// Shelf, LP branch for Low Shelf) via the fixed-Q 0.7071 SVF, brick-limits that
// branch to the ceiling, and passes the remainder untouched (perfect
// reconstruction). The guarantee bounds the extracted region contribution, not
// the summed output. The band Q shapes only the Mode A cut, never the Mode B split.

in_pin:Left
in_pin:Right
out_pin:Left
out_pin:Right

slider1:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Bypass
slider2:0<-16,16,1>-Output Macro (bits)
slider3:0<-100,100,0.1>-Output Micro (% bit)
slider4:2<0.1,10,0.1>-Lookahead (ms, Mode B)

slider11:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>B1 Enable
slider12:0<0,4,1{Bell,Low Shelf,High Shelf,High Pass,Low Pass}>B1 Type
slider13:100<20,20000,1>B1 Freq
slider14:0.707<0.1,10,0.001>B1 Q
slider15:0<-16,16,1>B1 Macro (bits)
slider16:0<-100,100,0.1>B1 Micro (% bit)
slider17:1<0,3,0.1>B1 Bit Ratio
slider18:0<0,4,1{Both,Mid,Side,Left,Right}>B1 Placement
slider19:0<0,1,0.001>B1 Q Character (0 Constant .. 1 Proportional)

slider21:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>B2 Enable
slider22:0<0,4,1{Bell,Low Shelf,High Shelf,High Pass,Low Pass}>B2 Type
slider23:1000<20,20000,1>B2 Freq
slider24:0.707<0.1,10,0.001>B2 Q
